EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에는 타학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">타학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 개설된 강좌에 여석이 있을 경우 전산으로만 수강신청 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">.</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강신청 확인 및 변경 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">(3. 18.~ 3. 20.)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 신청한 과목 삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">변경 및 신규추가 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">타학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">타학과에 개설된 과목 수강신청은 교과목코드 직접 입력하여 수강신청</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일부 강좌는 외국인 학생만 수강신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">한국어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1(LA0281-01), </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고급한국어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1(LA0283-01), </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기업윤리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">(BD0014-02), </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">소비자행동론</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">(BD0017-02)]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 개시 후 수강변경 및 수강정정으로 인한 수업 결손을 최소화 하고자 전체학년 수강신청 전에 일부 과목은 수강정원 조정 및 분반 추가개설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개설폐지 등 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 교과목 개설 내역이 변경될 수 있으니 확인 후 수강신청에 참고하시기 바람</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -107.2pt; margin-left: 107.2pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개설교과목 조회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">: 1) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학교홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로그인 필수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">) - </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">-&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개설과목안내&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -107.2pt; margin-left: 107.2pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">원스톱서비스 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">-&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학부 개설과목 조회</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -107.2pt; margin-left: 107.2pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강신청인원 초과 및 강의실 멀티미디어 장비유무 등의 사유로 강의실이 변경되는 강좌가 있을 수도 있으니 수업 전에 확인 필요함</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기타 수강신청에 대한 자세한 사항은 학사안내 공지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">“2020</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 수강신청 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">” </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강과목 변경신청서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부터 학과사무실로 제출바람</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">□ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강신청기간 동안 본인의 아이디 및 비밀번호 관리를 철저히 하여 수강신청 시 불미한 경우가 없도록 주의하시기 바라며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; fo